                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 9,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Republicans have already tried to repeal or weaken the ACA more than 70 times over the past 15 years, and now, instead of re-authorizing the ACA tax credits that make health care affordable for millions of Americans, Republicans are trying to repeal the ACA again. Let\u2019s be clear: when more Americans receive coverage, health care is more efficient, effective, and affordable for everyone. The ACA has allowed millions of Americans to access affordable health care \u2013 we cannot back down on the fight for the ACA tax credits that help our health care system as a whole.",
                "text_lang": "en",
