                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Leaving the House floor tonight, I wanted to take a minute to explain why I voted against the Republican spending bill. While I am glad this government shutdown is finally coming to a close, the work to lower your health care costs is far from over. https://t.co/oOjXQxCPzb",
