                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Congress is running out of time to extend the ACA tax credits and prevent health care costs from skyrocketing on January 1st for millions of Americans. That\u2019s why House Democrats first put forward a discharge petition to force a vote on the ACA tax credits. Now, I\u2019ve also joined @RepScholten and my other Lowering Costs Caucus colleagues to demand Speaker Johnson put these ACA tax credits to a vote. We\u2019ll continue to use every tool we have so that hardworking Americans can continue to afford the care they deserve.",
