                "text": "At our Monday town hall, a constituent asked a question many folks have: why are premiums increasing so much in 2026, and what is Congress doing about it? House Democrats are committed to using every legislative tool possible to extend the ACA tax credits and keep health care affordable for hardworking Americans. I hope my Republican colleagues join us in this fight.",
