                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "No one should face sexual harassment simply for visiting their doctor. Yet, when over 80 women serving in our nation\u2019s armed forces alleged that Dr. Major McGraw, a physician at Fort Hood and the Tripler Army Medical Center, made sexual advances towards them, leadership kept Dr. Major McGraw on staff. I\u2019ve joined my @DemWomenCaucus colleagues urging the DoD to investigate the Army\u2019s lack of intervention and ensure our servicewomen get the protections, answers, and justice they deserve.",
