                "text": "NOAA\u2019s Chesapeake Bay Office \u2013 located right here in #MD03 \u2013 conducts critical work across the Chesapeake Bay Watershed to advance our shared goal of restoring the health and habitat of the Bay. From water quality monitoring through the buoy system to convening an expert Task Force to tackle the invasive blue catfish issue, I\u2019m proud to join @BobbyScott and co-lead the Chesapeake Bay WATERS Act to reauthorize this office and continue the innovative work it conducts to preserve, protect, and restore our Bay for generations to come.",
